  "details": "I don't upload small avatar usually. But this time I run out into a strange issue. The Font in the expression menu get mipmap close to the player when closing and re-opening the menu. At first I test if it was a graphic card issue. A shader issue. An image import issue. etc... But behold, If was because the avatar was smaller then 1 meter. The issue don't occur when you get above that.\n\nThe avatar show use the SDK 2021.03.22.18.27 with the default descriptor setting beside the view point. Changing the view point height don't fix the issue.\n\nTo reproduce. Simply have any avatar below 1m in height. The smaller you are, more often you will get blurry text.",
